WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Now you have learned how it works.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Are you thinking — does it work for me?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
OxTube has been tested extensively in several university laboratories.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.500
We still test OxTube — and receive amazing results.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Here is one test run at a university laboratory for Pure Finland.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.500
Our client wanted to know whether OxTube would remove iron from raw water with low pH and no oxygen.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:43.000
The water goes through a sand filter, where the precipitated iron stays.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.500
Clear water flows into a small tank under the sand filter.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:55.500
The result is here — guess which sample went through OxTube and the sand filter, and which one didn't.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:03.000
So you are thinking: yes, it works in that case — but how about me and my case?

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.000
If we want to test OxTube with your water, we can do it very easily. Contact me.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.500
I will come with my testing kit, and we can run water through your system.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:26.000
Then you take the samples to your local laboratory — and check how much has been removed.
